  "question": {
    "text": "How many of the following groups are ortho, para directing and ring activating?<br />\r<br />\r<math><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math>"
  },
